        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐾 Claw your way to glory in this fast-paced 2D platformer-shooter adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless feline on a mission through <strong>six action-packed worlds</strong>, each teeming with enemies, hazards, and hidden treasures. Jump, slide, and blast your way through vibrant retro-style levels, collecting <strong>coins and rare gems</strong> to upgrade your abilities and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls, challenging platforming, and explosive combat, every level is a test of skill and reflexes. Upgrade your cat's powers—from a basic pistol to a fully automatic weapon, double jumps and bubble shield—as you prepare to face off against world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual cat lover or a hardcore arcade veteran, this game delivers the perfect mix of challenge, charm, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/6df78d202be88e28bb9511a4a45e1b4f.apng?t=1788655202\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/6df78d202be88e28bb9511a4a45e1b4f.poster.avif?t=1788655202\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d435702a836fff8a7ea95b4f4ca144a0.poster.avif?t=1788655202\" width=128 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d435702a836fff8a7ea95b4f4ca144a0.webm?t=1788655202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/f1ca4b12e56e284ea3531c3babcd8769.poster.avif?t=1788655202\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/f1ca4b12e56e284ea3531c3babcd8769.webm?t=1788655202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 More Ways to Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the game your own with <strong>new colour options and visual settings</strong>, giving you more control over how your adventure looks and feels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete <strong>UI overhaul throughout the game</strong> makes menus, HUD elements, information and progression easier to read, while giving the whole experience a cleaner, more polished look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your progress with <strong>new milestone trackers</strong>, showing off the achievements and milestones you've reached as you work your way through the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯 New In This Update: Bonus Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure isn't just about reaching the end of each level. <strong>Eight new bonus challenges</strong> have been added, giving you even more reasons to replay levels and put your skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From collecting and combat challenges to unusual objectives that demand a different approach, these challenges add an extra layer of unpredictability to your runs—and reward you for taking them on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚡ New In This Update: Level Modifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs have to feel the same. <strong>Six new level modifiers</strong> can shake up your adventure with unexpected twists and gameplay changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect familiar levels to become anything but familiar as modifiers alter the rules, challenge your reflexes and force you to adapt on the fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Bonus Content &amp; Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’re done? Think again. Try the hidden vault of <strong>eight bonus arcade-style minigames</strong> and an additional world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and rack up high scores in quirky trials like <strong>Coconut Catch</strong>, where timing is everything, or <strong>Ice Climb</strong>, a vertical sprint through slippery chaos. Test your limits in <strong>Endless Horde </strong>— survive as long as possible against waves featuring almost every enemy in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame offers a fresh twist on the core mechanics, complete with <strong>online leaderboards</strong> so you can compete with friends and claw your way to the top. These bite-sized challenges keep the fun going long after the final boss is defeated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌾The Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all that blasting and boss fighting, take a breather on your very own <strong>farm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops for profit, customize your land with decorations, and collect adorable (and sometimes strange) animal companions. Complete farm tasks, upgrade your facilities, and even collect rare critters from other worlds once you unlock the stables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, your farm can keep working for you. <strong>Earn passive income while you're playing the game</strong>, with your farm generating coins over time so there's always a reason to come back and check on your growing empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm is your cozy corner of calm between the chaos—a place to relax, earn rewards, build up your resources and make your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/32c2c2f2b22f3497de91af67cfa9419e.apng?t=1788655202\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/32c2c2f2b22f3497de91af67cfa9419e.poster.avif?t=1788655202\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d7a71d0e9325234ec79b05968332d6d4.apng?t=1788655202\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d7a71d0e9325234ec79b05968332d6d4.poster.avif?t=1788655202\" class=\"bb_img\" width=52 height=64 /></picture></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/294e128651b55dd1d638af93a5356557.apng?t=1788655202\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/294e128651b55dd1d638af93a5356557.poster.avif?t=1788655202\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐱 Explore. Upgrade. Replay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six worlds, bosses, bonus levels, minigames, challenges, modifiers, a fully featured farm, online leaderboards, milestones and plenty of upgrades to unlock, there's always another reason to jump back in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw your way through the worlds, master the challenges, build your farm and become the ultimate arcade cat.</strong></p>",
